1.Create a MySQL table called playlists to store Spotify-style music playlists, with columns: playlist_id (primary key), user_id (foreign key), name (varchar), and created_at (datetime). 
Write the CREATE TABLE statement.
Ans.
create table playlists (
    playlist_id int auto_increment primary key,
    user_id int not null,
    name varchar(100) not null,
    created_at datetime not null
);


